      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRACKERJACK SCUD (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and two minors from seven tries. Recorded a 4.5 lengths win (16.90) in a Free For All last time at this track. Rates on top and should go close. BOILER MAKER (3) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts two wins and three placings. Recorded a nose win (17.23) in a Grade 4/5 last time at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. JONAH TAKALUA (2) was a winner (17.35) at this track two back but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Form from his last run is proving strong. Expected to give a good account. QUEST FOR STEPS (7) cannot be left out over a shorter journey.",
